{
  "appid": 588650,
  "name": "Dead Cells",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "《死亡细胞》是一款融合了Roguelite和银河恶魔城元素的平台动作游戏。你将在游戏中探索一个庞大而不断变化的城堡……当然，前提是你能在这款2D轻度魂系游戏中战胜那些拦路的强敌们。别想着存档了——杀戮、死亡、反省，周而复始。",
  "about_the_game": "《死亡细胞》是一款融合了Roguelite和银河恶魔城元素的平台动作游戏。你将在游戏中探索一个庞大而不断变化的城堡……当然，前提是你能在这款2D轻度魂系游戏中战胜那些拦路的强敌们。别想着存档了——杀戮、死亡、反省，周而复始。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/e0eba0c607cfe799ed7b0a9cb53b022a.poster.avif?t=1779086887\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/e0eba0c607cfe799ed7b0a9cb53b022a.webm?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/e0eba0c607cfe799ed7b0a9cb53b022a.mp4?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>一场失败的炼金术实验，一座庞大而不断变化的诅咒岛屿，你穿行其中，试图搞清楚一切的来龙去脉。虽然你获得了永生，但行动却受限，于是只能借用尸体来移动、探索......当然还有战斗。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/7a9ee4d164b094443ad0c6eca439d85e.poster.avif?t=1779086887\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/7a9ee4d164b094443ad0c6eca439d85e.webm?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/7a9ee4d164b094443ad0c6eca439d85e.mp4?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>你虽然不朽，却难以保全占有的尸体。每当你的宿主被摧毁，你将被送回地牢，寻找一个新的宿主，并重新开始……<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/088445c09499282f4fec56bc400670c6.poster.avif?t=1779086887\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/088445c09499282f4fec56bc400670c6.webm?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/088445c09499282f4fec56bc400670c6.mp4?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>这就是“肉鸽恶魔城”——交错相同的世界、错综复杂的岔路，学习技能变强，但同时也面临着永久死亡带来的刺激。想要存档点？要么一次打通，要么就从头再来。但你的一些进度可以保留，比如一些让你直接进入新关卡的路线，还有直接获得的变异，技能和武器。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/7bb33ad5a5362f15ff5872ccf737fe36.poster.avif?t=1779086887\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/7bb33ad5a5362f15ff5872ccf737fe36.webm?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/588650/extras/7bb33ad5a5362f15ff5872ccf737fe36.mp4?t=1779086887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>是什么造就一款让你玩起来爽，有宣泄感的动作游戏？困难，但公平的战斗；爽快的操作感；有挑战性的敌人...当然，还有能让你溜之大吉的翻滚。&quot;",
